From 861f8387c798c9ac95deda3fab293d21850c4e71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?A=CC=82nderson=20Q?= <anquadros@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 14:37:38 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Fix E0716 risk in scrollbar background color lookup

cx.theme() now returns an owned Arc<Theme>; splitting the theme lookup
